  CellName: Chum
  Description: 'Crusted - intensity 3 of Chum: bigger shoals under a shielded crust no grazer can eat -
    the Angler starts at Space 5, whose Paint Shields cracks it. The standard 1200 u cell
    with its nucleus (~392 u). No environment prefab - the reef (12 shoals, 2,124 prisms of
    7 u, 1,356 of them shielded crust) is laid by ChumController. 12 tameable tadpoles graze
    it outside the nucleus; 3 omni crystals respawn inside it (the scene''s CrystalManager).
    Frenzy sits 25% above the full arena (4,181 prisms, 898,246 volume). Authored by
    Tools/Build/author_chum_assets.py - re-run it rather than hand-editing.'
